TITLE Batch exchange to get NaX in solution 1

SOLUTION 1
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
    units mol/kgw

EXCHANGE 1
    X- 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

USER_PUNCH
    -headings NaX_m CaX2_m
    10 PUNCH MOL("NaX")
    20 PUNCH MOL("CaX2")

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file exch_batch.txt
    -reset false
END
